<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sampo Jan-Mar pretax down 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sampo Jan-Mar pretax down 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-March 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				4,368 vs 5,050</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			   113 vs   150</p>
<p>NOTE - Sampo Corp is one of Taiwan's leading electrical appliance and electronic product makers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
